+			// Keep early checks immediate. After the upstream burst, use the existing
+			// entry/timer at 2 s intervals while slow signaling reaches the peer.
+			// Never extend an established session, a send failure, or the absolute deadline.
+			if (!check_expired && (entry->retransmissions >= 0 || initial_check)) {
